[{"id":"1034459378202624000","date":1535469309000,"rawContent":"Among liberals, this idiotic McCain #MeToo-ism is a sign of that rudderless left I keep discussing.  So long as the Establishment left needs the myth of the \"moderate Republican,\" McCain will be a hero to them. We need new voices that dispel these myths, not empower them.","media":null,"username":"Shoq","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":326,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":45,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1039118671342391296","date":1536580171000,"rawContent":"Harvey Weinstein had a lot of power, but not major TV network power.  Consider that Moonves  is the only #metoo perp to survive this long after some very large and credible  allegations.  Don't be shocked if he survives this round, too.","media":null,"username":"Shoq","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":326,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":46,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1039207245018542080","date":1536601289000,"rawContent":"I don't think men fully get it yet.  Whether you approve or not, #MeToo means that the rules are different now. But you're still free to sexually harass at will.  Just be prepared to pay for it with your reputation, your credibility, your career, and possibly your freedom.","media":null,"username":"Shoq","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":326,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":47,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOf